OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith the cloud well broken at times.
OL,7,FHowever, patchy rain is possible, the
OL,8,Frain mainly through Moray and western
OL,9,FAberdeenshire. Breezy and very mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy or bright with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of rain at times. The odd
OL,13,Fheavier burst possible and winds
OL,14,Fmostly light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FBright spells and showers, some of the
OL,18,Fshowers heavy. A more organised band
OL,19,Fof heavy and perhaps thundery rain
OL,20,Fcould cross from the west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
